INSERT INTO `News` VALUES (1,'BTC','2025-03-25 05:53:55','Bitcoin in the bush - the crypto mine in remote Zambia','Bitcoin miners will go to remote locations to take advantage of cheap electricity.','BBC News'),(2,'BTC','2025-03-07 17:31:00','Trump Signs Executive Order Creating a Strategic Bitcoin Reserve. What Does It Mean for Cryptocurrency?','Similar to how the government has a reserve of other currencies such as gold, this reserve houses the country\'s digital currency.','CNET'),(3,'BTC','2025-03-19 05:04:25','Cathie Wood says people are going to learn the hard way that meme coins are the worst','Wood, who has been bullish about cryptocurrencies like bitcoin, said her private funds are not investing in meme coins.','Business Insider'),(4,'BTC','2025-03-07 23:20:00','Trump Signs Order To Establish Strategic Bitcoin Reserve','President Trump has signed an executive order to establish a strategic reserve of cryptocurrencies by using tokens already owned by the government. Reuters reports: A \"Strategic Bitcoin Reserve\" will be capitalized with bitcoin owned by the federal government…','Slashdot.org'),(5,'BTC','2025-03-24 10:00:00','The Quantum Apocalypse Is Coming. Be Very Afraid','What happens when quantum computers can finally crack encryption and break into the world’s best-kept secrets? It’s called Q-Day—the worst holiday maybe ever.','Wired'),(6,'BTC','2025-03-31 20:35:52','Watch Live as SpaceX Launches Private Crew to Elusive Polar Orbit','The Fram2 mission is set for launch on Monday at 9:46 p.m. ET.','Gizmodo.com'),(7,'BTC','2025-03-19 12:10:04','Czech central banker Kubicek \'sceptical\' of bitcoin as reserve asset','Czech National Bank board member Jan Kubicek is \"sceptical\" about the inclusion of bitcoin among the bank\'s hefty reserves, wary of legal uncertainties and...','Yahoo Entertainment'),(8,'BTC','2025-03-26 23:21:12','GameStop to Borrow $1.3 Billion to Fund Bitcoin Buying Spree',NULL,'Yahoo Entertainment'),(9,'BTC','2025-03-09 17:50:56','U.S. Housing Agency Considers Launching Crypto Experiment','HUD is pondering using the blockchain and a stablecoin. One HUD official derided it as “monopoly money.”','Gizmodo.com'),(10,'BTC','2025-03-24 13:48:46','Bitcoin price rises but odds suggest it may have already peaked this year','Odds on prediction market platform Polymarket point to bitcoin\'s price heading lower still.','Yahoo Entertainment'),(11,'BTC','2025-04-01 18:40:00','Larry Fink Says Bitcoin Could Replace the Dollar as the World\'s Reserve Currency Because of National Debt','With America\'s national debt sitting comfortably over the $36.2 trillion mark, BlackRock CEO Larry Fink is warning the burden could one day be the reason the dollar is dethroned as the reserve currency of the world.\n From a report: He argues that decentralize…','Slashdot.org'),(12,'BTC','2025-03-07 21:57:13','White House crypto czar says public has \'lost out on over $17 billion\'','Crypto czar David Sacks argued taxpayers have lost out on billions because earlier administrations never took advantage of bitcoin in the government\'s possession.','ABC News'),(13,'BTC','2025-04-04 14:35:29','Watch Live as SpaceX’s Private Fram2 Crew Returns From Polar Orbit','After splashdown, the crew will attempt to exit the vehicle without assistance to assess their physical capabilities.','Gizmodo.com'),(14,'BTC','2025-03-08 11:30:00','Cybercriminals Allegedly Used a StubHub Backdoor to Steal Taylor Swift Tickets','Plus: The world’s “largest illicit online marketplace” gets hit by regulators, police seize the Garantex crypto exchange, and scammers trick targets by making up ransomware attacks.','Wired'),(15,'BTC','2025-04-01 19:45:52','SpaceX Shares Stunning Polar Views From Its Historic Fram2 Mission','SpaceX launched the private Fram2 crew into an orbit never before traveled by humans.','Gizmodo.com'),(16,'BTC','2025-03-10 12:15:00','Crypto Daybook Americas: Bitcoin Slumps as Investors Flock to \'Doomsday Asset\' Gold',NULL,'Yahoo Entertainment'),(17,'BTC','2025-03-15 13:00:00','Tesla stock bleeds, recession fears — and Bitcoin $200,000: Markets news roundup',NULL,'Yahoo Entertainment'),(18,'BTC','2025-03-25 03:33:13','Crypto Community Buzzes as $250 Million Bitcoin Whale Returns from Hibernation, Is It A Good Sign?',NULL,'Yahoo Entertainment'),(19,'BTC','2025-03-13 15:07:00','Think You Know Bitcoin? Here\'s 1 Little-Known Fact You Can\'t Overlook.',NULL,'Yahoo Entertainment'),(20,'BTC','2025-03-12 11:01:51','What Would Make Bitcoin Fall to Zero? 4 Things That Give It Value',NULL,'Yahoo Entertainment'),(21,'BTC','2025-03-07 12:09:16','Monthly jobs report to be released. And, the White House to host a crypto event','The Labor Department will release the monthly jobs report card today, which is expected to show solid growth. But that\'s not the whole picture. And, the White House will host a cryptocurrency summit.','NPR'),(22,'BTC','2025-03-08 00:00:00','Trump’s Crypto Reserve Is Really Happening','Now what?','The Atlantic'),(23,'BTC','2025-04-02 21:20:18','Motion Sickness Hits Hard as Space Tourists Describe Polar Orbit Adventure','After adjusting to microgravity—and getting through a few bouts of vomiting—the astronauts got to work in polar orbit.','Gizmodo.com'),(24,'BTC','2025-03-11 22:17:04','Is Tesla cooked?','Tesla stock plunged 15 percent on Monday, its steepest drop in five years. The price is down over 50 percent since its December highs. Tesla owners, disgusted with Elon Muskâs slash-and-burn tactics for the Trump administration, are selling their vehicles a…','The Verge'),(25,'BTC','2025-03-10 12:52:26','How to protect yourself from a recession','The economy might take a dive, but you don\'t have to let it take you down with it.','Business Insider'),(26,'BTC','2025-03-07 20:36:12','Crypto takes a dip as Trump signs Bitcoin Reserve order','With no allowance to sell and little room to buy, and markets on the slide, it\'s UB40 time: Red, red, whine\nComment It\'s official: President Donald Trump signed an executive order Thursday to create a US Bitcoin reserve and stockpile of related digital assets…','Theregister.com'),(27,'BTC','2025-03-18 17:20:05','Gemini Credit Card','You spend money every day. Make it work for you while building a crypto portfolio with the Gemini Credit Card. Earn instant* rewards in Bitcoin, Solana, or 50+ other cryptocurrencies with every purchase. Customers can earn 4% back on gas...','Uncrate.com'),(28,'BTC','2025-03-31 17:38:50','Analysts say Bitcoin reacted to inflation before the Fed woke up',NULL,'Yahoo Entertainment'),(29,'BTC','2025-03-31 22:43:00','Bitcoin Is Down 22% From Its Peak. History Says This Will Happen Next.',NULL,'Yahoo Entertainment'),(30,'BTC','2025-03-27 09:45:05','Like DOGE, XRP Going Vertical Is a Good Indicator of Market Froth, Bitcoin Peaks',NULL,'Yahoo Entertainment'),(31,'BTC','2025-03-28 14:00:00','Meet the astronauts of SpaceX\'s Fram2 mission, the 1st to fly over Earth\'s poles','The crew of SpaceX\'s pioneering Fram2 mission includes a polar explorer, a marine technology scientist, a filmmaker and a bitcoin magnate.','Space.com'),(32,'BTC','2025-04-01 11:35:01','Tether acquired 8,888 bitcoin worth $735M in Q1 2025, taking its total holdings to $7.8B and making it the sixth-largest bitcoin holder in a single wallet (Yogita Khatri/The Block)','Yogita Khatri / The Block:\nTether acquired 8,888 bitcoin worth $735M in Q1 2025, taking its total holdings to $7.8B and making it the sixth-largest bitcoin holder in a single wallet  —  Quick Take Tether acquired 8,888 BTC (worth about $735 million) in Q1 202…','Techmeme.com'),(33,'BTC','2025-03-07 15:30:00','Bitcoin fell all the way to $84,000 as Trump\'s crypto reserve failed to impress','Just hours before the White House Crypto Summit, President Donald Trump signed an executive order to establish a strategic Bitcoin reserve and a separate stockpile of other digital assets. The news plunged Bitcoin to $84,000 Thursday evening, however, as the …','Quartz India'),(34,'BTC','2025-03-07 19:01:08','WATCH: Endangered cheetah sanctuary breaks ground in Africa','Cheetah Conservation Fund founder Laurie Marker discusses her organization’s fight to save cheetahs throughout the continent.','ABC News'),(35,'BTC','2025-03-09 03:32:23','David Sacks says the US may have lost over $16 billion in early liquidation of bitcoins','Trump\'s executive order launching a Strategic Bitcoin Reserve marks a shift in US crypto policy, as David Sacks reveals a $16 billion bitcoin misstep.','Business Insider'),(36,'BTC','2025-03-08 15:10:59','WATCH: How social media helped fuel a female mechanic\'s business','ABC News\' Will Ganss is here with the story about Desiree Hill who found a massive online community when switching from nursing to auto work.','ABC News'),(37,'BTC','2025-03-08 02:17:22','WATCH: Bald eagle nest cam captures live hatch in California','A live camera stream of a bald eagle nest in Southern California has gained viral attention, attracting hundreds of thousands of views this week.','ABC News'),(38,'BTC','2025-04-04 14:12:19','What Are Stablecoins?','Stablecoins—cryptocurrencies tied to the U.S. dollar—are gaining traction globally and in Washington, with The STABLE and GENIUS Acts.','Time'),(39,'BTC','2025-03-08 16:04:12','WATCH: Hockey great Alex Ovechkin making a difference','Alex Ovechkin, one of the greatest hockey players of all time, is approaching Wayne Gretzky\'s all-time record of 894 goals scored while playing for a great cause.','ABC News'),(40,'BTC','2025-03-11 09:00:00','Bitcoin is here to stay — and heading to $200,000, Anthony Scaramucci says','SkyBridge Capital CEO Anthony Scaramucci is pretty optimistic about the future of Bitcoin, as his former boss, President Donald Trump, directs his administration’s friendly approach to cryptocurrency.Read more...','Quartz India'),(41,'BTC','2025-03-07 05:26:23','Bitcoin plunges as Trump’s strategic reserve fails to impress markets','Cryptocurrency falls as much as 6 percent 